// N-D box-size changes keep the warm seed on its lattice coordinates
// (synced from pysfbox-dev PR #170, 28 Oct 2026). A restricted (A)10
// droplet in a 2-D flat 12x12 box (mirror on all four sides) is nucleated
// with a pinned corner patch (start 1), released (start 2), then
//   start 3: var scan n_layers_y 12 -> 14 (one step of 2: the INNER axis of
//            the C-order padded grid changes, so every row has a new stride);
//   start 4: n_layers_x 14 / n_layers_y 12 -- the same M as 12x14 with the
//            axes swapped (the transposed box); the inherited scan then
//            grows it to 14x14.
// runner._remap_layers applies the two-wall split PER AXIS (_grid_shape =
// LatticeND.pdims), and an equal-M reshape is a grid change, not a plain
// x_prev seed.
// CHECKS at creation:
//  - the ny = 14 row equals the droplet nucleated DIRECTLY in a 12x14 box
//    (same two starts at n_layers_y 14): F -0.8919520357 / Omega 0.7846974981
//    vs scan F -0.8919520208 / Omega 0.7846974932 (solver floor, tol 1e-8);
//  - the 14x12 row equals the 12x14 row by the x <-> y mirror symmetry;
//  - the 14x14 row equals the droplet nucleated directly in 14x14;
//  - every row equals pysfbox-dev's output on this input (solver floor).
// The pre-fix code split each flat block as a 1-D column, which sheared the
// droplet diagonally across the box: with this iterationlimit the ny = 14
// step converged (31394 iterations) onto the TWO-HALF-DROPLET branch,
// F -0.2084841 / Omega 1.2280910, 0.68 kT above the continuation, with no
// note; at the default limit it failed, retried cold and recorded the
// uniform state. The swapped start passed the 12x14 seed through unchanged.
// No Namics oracle (an N-D warm-seed path; the converged states are pinned
// by the direct solves above).
lat : NN : gradients : 2
lat : NN : geometry : flat
lat : NN : n_layers_x : 12
lat : NN : n_layers_y : 12
lat : NN : lowerbound_x : mirror
lat : NN : upperbound_x : mirror
lat : NN : lowerbound_y : mirror
lat : NN : upperbound_y : mirror
mon : A : freedom : pinned
mon : A : pinned_range : 1,1;5,5
mon : W : freedom : free
mon : A : chi_W : 1.5
mol : A : composition : (A)10
mol : A : freedom : restricted
mol : A : theta : 20
mol : W : composition : (W)1
mol : W : freedom : solvent
newton : n : tolerance : 1e-8
newton : n : iterationlimit : 30000
output : kal : append : false
kal : mol : A : phiMax
kal : lat : NN : n_layers_x
kal : lat : NN : n_layers_y
kal : sys : NN : free_energy
kal : sys : NN : grand_potential
start
mon : A : freedom : free
start
var : lat-NN : scan : n_layers_y
var : lat-NN : step : 2
var : lat-NN : end_value : 14
start
lat : NN : n_layers_x : 14
lat : NN : n_layers_y : 12
start
